ption\">\n   759→                            Mozilla used Claude Mythos preview to find and fix hundreds of Firefox vulnerabilities. Firefox went from fixing 20-30 bugs/month to <span class=\"highlight\">423 in April 2026</span>.\n   760→                        </div>\n   761→                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n   762→                            <span class=\"date-badge\">2026-05-07</span>\n   763→                        </div>\n   764→                        <div class=\"topics\">\n   765→                            <span class=\"tag\">mozilla</span>\n   766→                            <span class=\"tag\">security</span>\n   767→                        </div>\n   768→                    </div>\n   769→\n   770→                    <div class=\"item\">\n   771→                        <div class=\"insight-type opinion\">OPINION</div>\n   772→                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n   773→                            <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/May/7/xai-anthropic-data-center/\" target=\"_blank\">xAI/Anthropic data center deal</a>\n   774→                        </div>\n   775→                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n   776→                            Anthropic struck deal with SpaceX/xAI to use \"all of the capacity of their Colossus data center\" - one of biggest announcements at Code w/ Claude 2026.\n   777→                        </div>\n   778→                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n   779→                            <span class=\"date-badge\">2026-05-07</span>\n   780→                        </div>\n   781→                        <div class=\"topics\">\n   782→                            <span class=\"tag\">anthropic</span>\n   783→                            <span class=\"tag\">xai</span>\n   784→                        </div>\n   785→                    </div>\n   786→\n   787→                    <div class=\"item\">\n   788→                        <div class=\"insight-type technical\">TECHNICAL