    "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Agentic Coding Research Report - 2026-05-13</title>\n    <style>\n        * {\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n        }\n\n        body {\n            font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\n            background-color: #f6f6ef;\n            color: #000000;\n            line-height: 1.5;\n            font-size: 10pt;\n        }\n\n        a {\n            color: #000000;\n            text-decoration: none;\n        }\n\n        a:hover {\n            text-decoration: underline;\n        }\n\n        .header {\n            background-color: #ff6600;\n            padding: 2px 6px;\n            border-bottom: 1px solid #d4d4d4;\n        }\n\n        .header-content {\n            max-width: 1400px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            gap: 10px;\n        }\n\n        .header h1 {\n            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n            font-size: 14pt;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            color: #000000;\n        }\n\n        .header .date {\n            font-size: 10pt;\n            color: #000000;\n        }\n\n        .header nav {\n            margin-left: auto;\n        }\n\n        .header nav a {\n            color: #000000;\n            margin-left: 15px;\n            font-size: 10pt;\n        }\n\n        .container {\n            max-width: 1400px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            padding: 10px 6px;\n        }\n\n        .three-column-layout {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr 0.8fr;\n            gap: 15px;\n            margin-top: 10px;\n        }\n\n        .column {\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            border: 1px solid #d4d4d4;\n            border-radius: 2px;\n        }\n\n        .column-header {\n            background-color: #ff6600;\n            padding: 4px 8px;\n            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n            font-size: 11pt;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            border-bottom: 1px solid #d4d4d4;\n        }\n\n        .column-content {\n            padding: 8px;\n        }\n\n        .item {\n            margin-bottom: 12px;\n            padding-bottom: 10px;\n            border-bottom: 1px solid #eeeeee;\n        }\n\n        .item:last-child {\n            border-bottom: none;\n            margin-bottom: 0;\n        }\n\n        .item-title {\n            font-size: 10pt;\n            margin-bottom: 4px;\n            line-height: 1.4;\n        }\n\n        .item-title a {\n            color: #000000;\n            font-weight: normal;\n        }\n\n        .item-title a:hover {\n            color: #000000;\n        }\n\n        .item-description {\n            font-size: 9pt;\n            color: #828282;\n            margin-bottom: 4px;\n            line-height: 1.4;\n        }\n\n        .item-meta {\n            font-size: 8pt;\n            color: #828282;\n        }\n\n        .item-meta a {\n            color: #828282;\n        }\n\n        .item-meta a:hover {\n            color: #000000;\n        }\n\n        .tag {\n            display: inline-block;\n            background-color: #f0f0f0;\n            padding: 1px 4px;\n            border-radius: 2px;\n            font-size: 8pt;\n            margin-right: 4px;\n            margin-top: 4px;\n        }\n\n        .quote {\n            background-color: #f9f9f9;\n            border-left: 3px solid #ff6600;\n            padding: 6px 8px;\n            margin: 6px 0;\n            font-size: 9pt;\n            color: #555555;\n            font-style: italic;\n            line-height: 1.4;\n        }\n\n        .update-type {\n            display: inline-block;\n            padding: 2px 6px;\n            border-radius: 2px;\n            font-size: 8pt;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            margin-bottom: 4px;\n        }\n\n        .update-type.release {\n            background-color: #e6f7ff;\n            color: #0066cc;\n        }\n\n        .update-type.feature {\n            background-color: #f6ffed;\n            color: #52c41a;\n        }\n\n        .update-type.announcement {\n            background-color: #fff7e6;\n            color: #fa8c16;\n        }\n\n        .topics {\n            margin-top: 4px;\n        }\n\n        .highlight {\n            background-color: #ffffd0;\n            padding: 1px 3px;\n        }\n\n        .insight-type {\n            font-size: 7pt;\n            text-transform: uppercase;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            margin-bottom: 3px;\n            display: inline-block;\n        }\n\n        .insight-type.technical {\n            color: #ff6600;\n        }\n\n        .insight-type.opinion {\n            color: #0066cc;\n        }\n\n        .insight-type.discussion {\n            color: #009900;\n        }\n\n        .footer {\n            max-width: 1400px;\n            margin: 20px auto 0;\n            padding: 10px 6px;\n            border-top: 1px solid #d4d4d4;\n            text-align: center;\n            font-size: 9pt;\n            color: #828282;\n        }\n\n        .footer a {\n            color: #828282;\n            margin: 0 10px;\n        }\n\n        .footer a:hover {\n            color: #000000;\n        }\n\n        .section-count {\n            font-size: 8pt;\n            color: #000000;\n            font-weight: normal;\n            margin-left: 5px;\n        }\n\n        .date-badge {\n            display: inline-block;\n            background-color: #e0e0e0;\n            color: #000000;\n            padding: 1px 4px;\n            border-radius: 2px;\n            font-size: 8pt;\n            margin-left: 4px;\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 1200px) {\n            .three-column-layout {\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n            }\n\n            .technical-insights {\n                grid-column: 1 / -1;\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 768px) {\n            .three-column-layout {\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n            }\n\n            body {\n                font-size: 11pt;\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media print {\n            body {\n                background-color: #ffffff;\n            }\n\n            .column {\n                border: 1px solid #000000;\n                page-break-inside: avoid;\n            }\n\n            .column-header {\n                background-color: #eeeeee !important;\n                -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact;\n                print-color-adjust: exact;\n            }\n\n            a {\n                color: #000000 !important;\n                text-decoration: underline;\n            }\n\n            .item {\n                page-break-inside: avoid;\n            }\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <header class=\"header\">\n        <div class=\"header-content\">\n            <h1>Agentic Coding Daily Report</h1>\n            <span class=\"date\">May 13, 2026</span>\n            <nav>\n                <a href=\"#new-products\">New Products</a>\n                <a href=\"#whitelist-updates\">Updates</a>\n                <a href=\"#insights\">Insights</a>\n            </nav>\n        </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <main class=\"three-column-layout\">\n            <!-- New Products Section -->\n            <section class=\"column\" id=\"new-products\">\n                <div class=\"column-header\">\n                    New Products <span class=\"section-count\">(5)</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"column-content\">\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://github.com/av/mi\" target=\"_blank\">Mi</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            30-line zero-config CLI agent for bug fixes and refactoring. Autonomous coding agent that fits in a single JavaScript file with no framework or dependencies beyond Node builtins. Works with any OpenAI-compatible API.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"tag\">AI coding CLI</span>\n                            <span class=\"tag\">GitHub</span>\n                            <span class=\"date-badge\">2026-05-12</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"quote\">\n                            \"how small can an agentic harness be and remain useful? turns out, very small. Claude Code is ~500k lines of code, OpenCode is ~100k, mi is 30 lines, yet, it has all the features expected from agentic harness\"\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://github.com/linchpinhq/linchpin\" target=\"_blank\">Linchpin</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Open-source, self-hostable runtime for managed AI agents under Apache-2.0 license. Deploy with single 'docker compose up' command to get a full agent platform with REST + SSE API, per-session Docker sandbox, MCP tools, encrypted vaults.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"tag\">code agent infrastructure</span>\n                            <span class=\"tag\">GitHub</span>\n                            <span class=\"date-badge\">2026-05-12</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"quote\">\n                            \"Every time Devin, Manus, or Operator launched, the top comment on HN was some variant of 'is this open source?' The answer kept being no. So we built Linchpin.\"\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://github.com/aaronkwhite/bosshogg-cli\" target=\"_blank\">BossHogg</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Agent-first CLI for PostHog analytics and feature flags. Gives AI coding agents a compact, scriptable way to operate PostHog without loading a large MCP tool surface. Supports HogQL queries and production-safe analytics operations.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"tag\">AI coding CLI</span>\n                            <span class=\"tag\">GitHub</span>\n                            <span class=\"date-badge\">2026-05-12</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"quote\">\n                            \"MCPs have a purpose. CLIs have a purpose. PostHog MCP is great for rich assistant workflows... But when you are working inside Claude Code, Cursor, scripts, or CI, you often want something smaller and more deterministic\"\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://xyops.io\" target=\"_blank\">xyOps</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Open-source operations automation platform for self-hosted teams under BSD-3-Clause license. Schedule jobs, build visual workflows, monitor servers, trigger alerts. Full app feature set is open source - no enterprise fork.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"tag\">workflow agent</span>\n                            <span class=\"tag\">Product Hunt</span>\n                            <span class=\"date-badge\">2026-05-09</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"quote\">\n                            \"The full app is open source under BSD-3-Clause. There is no separate enterprise fork, no hidden feature set, no license key, and no telemetry.\"\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://mycelis.ai\" target=\"_blank\">Mycelis</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Serverless AI workspace with smart routing and MCP agents. Abstracts hardware completely - instantly spin up open-source models on optimized GPUs or bring your own keys. Features conditional smart routing to optimal models.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"tag\">AI infrastructure</span>\n                            <span class=\"tag\">Product Hunt</span>\n                            <span class=\"date-badge\">2026-05-12</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"quote\">\n                            \"routing specific tasks to the most optimal model is the absolute best way forward\"\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- Whitelist Updates Section -->\n            <section class=\"column\" id=\"whitelist-updates\">\n                <div class=\"column-header\">\n                    Product Updates <span class=\"section-count\">(11)</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"column-content\">\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <span class=\"update-type release\">Claude Code</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            v2.1.140 - Enhanced Agent Tool Matching\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Improves agent tool subagent_type matching with case- and separator-insensitive values. Fixed /goal hanging with disableAllHooks, resolved settings hot-reload issues with symlinked files.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/changelog\" target=\"_blank\">Changelog</a>\n                            <span class=\"date-badge\">2026-05-12</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <span class=\"update-type feature\">Claude Code</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            v2.1.139 - Agent View and /goal Command\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Adds agent view (Research Preview) showing all Claude Code sessions. Introduced /goal command to set completion conditions with live elapsed/turns/tokens overlay. Added /scroll-speed command.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/changelog\" target=\"_blank\">Changelog</a>\n                            <span class=\"date-badge\">2026-05-11</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <span class=\"update-type feature\">Devin</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            May 2026 Updates - Enterprise Features\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Sensitive toggle for secrets with mask/visible options, merged multi-edits in progress tab, session category/subcategory in v3 API, wide markdown tables in chat, SSO connection picker.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <a href=\"https://docs.devin.ai/release-notes/2026\" target=\"_blank\">Release notes</a>\n                            <span class=\"date-badge\">2026-05-10</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <span class=\"update-type announcement\">Claude Code</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            Market Dominance and <span class=\"highlight\">$30B ARR</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Claude Code has become the most-used AI coding tool, overtaking GitHub Copilot and Cursor in just eight months. Anthropic disclosed $30B ARR with 80x year-over-year growth. Captures 30% of CLI-based coding market.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <a href=\"https://dev.to/alexmercedcoder/ai-weekly-claude-code-dominates-mcp-goes-mainstream-week-of-march-5-2026-15af\" target=\"_blank\">Read more</a>\n                            <span class=\"date-badge\">2026-05-08</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <span class=\"update-type feature\">Windsurf</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            v2.2.17 - Devin Review & Quick Review\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            All Windsurf IDE users now have access to Devin Review and Quick Review. Agent Command Center improvements include list display option, improved sorting/filtering, and performance enhancements.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <a href=\"https://windsurf.com/changelog\" target=\"_blank\">Changelog</a>\n                            <span class=\"date-badge\">2026-05-06</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <span class=\"update-type release\">Gemini CLI</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            v0.41.0 - Real-time Voice Mode\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Real-time voice mode with cloud and local processing backends. Secure .env loading with workspace trust, stronger shell command capabilities, and bug fixes.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <a href=\"https://geminicli.com/docs/changelogs/\" target=\"_blank\">Changelog</a>\n                            <span class=\"date-badge\">2026-05-05</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <span class=\"update-type feature\">Aider</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            Claude 4.5/4.6 and Gemini 3 Support\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Main branch now supports Claude 4.5/4.6 models with updated aliases. Expanded Gemini support includes 2.5 Flash and Flash-Lite, plus Gemini 3 preview models. Added DeepSeek Reasoner support.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <a href=\"https://aider.chat/HISTORY.html\" target=\"_blank\">History</a>\n                            <span class=\"date-badge\">2026-05-01</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <span class=\"update-type release\">Gemini CLI</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            v0.40.0 - Offline Search and Memory\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Bundled ripgrep for offline search support and GitHub-style colorblind themes. MCP resource tools and prompt-driven four-tier memory management system.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <a href=\"https://geminicli.com/docs/changelogs/\" target=\"_blank\">Changelog</a>\n                            <span class=\"date-badge\">2026-04-28</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <span class=\"update-type feature\">Devin</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            MCP Marketplace and Theme Selector\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Added Datadog and Amplitude to MCP marketplace as remote servers with OAuth. Theme selector now generally available. Wiki v2 uses stronger reasoning with subagents.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <a href=\"https://docs.devin.ai/release-notes/2026\" target=\"_blank\">Release notes</a>\n                            <span class=\"date-badge\">2026-04-25</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <span class=\"update-type release\">Aider</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            v0.86.0 - GPT-5 and Grok-4 Support\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Expands GPT-5 model support across family variants and providers including dated and chat/mini/nano variants. Aider wrote 88% of the code in this release.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <a href=\"https://aider.chat/HISTORY.html\" target=\"_blank\">Release notes</a>\n                            <span class=\"date-badge\">2026-04-20</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <span class=\"update-type release\">Devin</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            v2.2 - <span class=\"highlight\">3x Faster Startup</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            3x faster startup time, new UI connecting entire dev lifecycle, and smoother Slack/Linear integrations. Full desktop testing capability with computer control on Linux apps.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <a href=\"https://docs.devin.ai/release-notes/2026\" target=\"_blank\">Release notes</a>\n                            <span class=\"date-badge\">2026-04-15</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- Technical Insights Section -->\n            <section class=\"column technical-insights\" id=\"insights\">\n                <div class=\"column-header\">\n                    Insights <span class=\"section-count\">(14)</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"column-content\">\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"insight-type technical\">TECHNICAL</div>\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=40812345\" target=\"_blank\">Show HN: Needle</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Gemini Tool Calling distilled to 26M model - showing how expensive AI capabilities can be compressed for edge deployment.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"date-badge\">2026-05-13</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"topics\">\n                            <span class=\"tag\">model-distillation</span>\n                            <span class=\"tag\">tool-calling</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"insight-type technical\">TECHNICAL</div>\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=40812890\" target=\"_blank\">Agentic interface for mainframes</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            AI-powered interface making mainframe and COBOL systems accessible through agentic AI, addressing legacy system maintenance skills gap.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"date-badge\">2026-05-13</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"topics\">\n                            <span class=\"tag\">cobol</span>\n                            <span class=\"tag\">mainframes</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"insight-type technical\">TECHNICAL</div>\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=40812945\" target=\"_blank\">Statewright: Visual state machines</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Visual state machine framework making AI agents more reliable through structured state management, addressing reliability challenges.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"date-badge\">2026-05-13</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"topics\">\n                            <span class=\"tag\">ai-agents</span>\n                            <span class=\"tag\">state-machines</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"insight-type technical\">TECHNICAL</div>\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=40813456\" target=\"_blank\">Launch HN: Voker (YC S24)</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Analytics and observability tools specifically for AI agent systems, reflecting growing need for monitoring and debugging tools.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"date-badge\">2026-05-13</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"topics\">\n                            <span class=\"tag\">ai-agents</span>\n                            <span class=\"tag\">analytics</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"insight-type technical\">TECHNICAL</div>\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://tanstack.com/blog/changelog/npm-postmortem\" target=\"_blank\">TanStack NPM supply-chain compromise</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Detailed postmortem of supply-chain attack on popular TanStack library, highlighting npm security challenges and package integrity importance.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"date-badge\">2026-05-12</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"topics\">\n                            <span class=\"tag\">security</span>\n                            <span class=\"tag\">supply-chain</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"insight-type opinion\">OPINION</div>\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://x.com/karpathy/status/2004607146781278521\" target=\"_blank\">Karpathy: 'Never felt this much behind'</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            At Sequoia AI Ascent 2026, Karpathy reflected on programming being dramatically refactored by AI, expressing feeling more behind than ever.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"date-badge\">2026-05-10</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"topics\">\n                            <span class=\"tag\">ai-coding</span>\n                            <span class=\"tag\">vibe-coding</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"insight-type discussion\">DISCUSSION</div>\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/May/10/nyt-hallucination/\" target=\"_blank\">NYT AI Hallucination Correction</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            NYT issued editors' note after AI-generated summary was incorrectly rendered as direct quotation, highlighting risks in journalism without verification.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"date-badge\">2026-05-10</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"topics\">\n                            <span class=\"tag\">ai-ethics</span>\n                            <span class=\"tag\">hallucinations</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"insight-type technical\">TECHNICAL</div>\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/May/9/webrtc-openai/\" target=\"_blank\">OpenAI's WebRTC Problem with Voice AI</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            WebRTC aggressively drops audio packets for low latency, but for LLM voice apps where users are \"paying to boil the ocean,\" accurate transmission matters more than 200ms savings.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"date-badge\">2026-05-09</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"topics\">\n                            <span class=\"tag\">webrtc</span>\n                            <span class=\"tag\">openai</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"insight-type technical\">TECHNICAL</div>\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/May/8/html/\" target=\"_blank\">Using Claude Code: HTML Effectiveness</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Thariq Shihipar advocates for HTML over Markdown - allows SVG diagrams, interactive widgets, in-page navigation, and rich styling for LLM outputs.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"date-badge\">2026-05-08</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"topics\">\n                            <span class=\"tag\">claude-code</span>\n                            <span class=\"tag\">html</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"insight-type technical\">TECHNICAL</div>\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/May/7/firefox-claude-mythos/\" target=\"_blank\">Hardening Firefox with Claude Mythos</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Mozilla used Claude Mythos preview to find and fix hundreds of Firefox vulnerabilities. Firefox went from fixing 20-30 bugs/month to <span class=\"highlight\">423 in April 2026</span>.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"date-badge\">2026-05-07</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"topics\">\n                            <span class=\"tag\">mozilla</span>\n                            <span class=\"tag\">security</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"insight-type opinion\">OPINION</div>\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/May/7/xai-anthropic-data-center/\" target=\"_blank\">xAI/Anthropic data center deal</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Anthropic struck deal with SpaceX/xAI to use \"all of the capacity of their Colossus data center\" - one of biggest announcements at Code w/ Claude 2026.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"date-badge\">2026-05-07</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"topics\">\n                            <span class=\"tag\">anthropic</span>\n                            <span class=\"tag\">xai</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"insight-type technical\">TECHNICAL</div>\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/May/6/code-w-claude-2026/\" target=\"_blank\">Live blog: Code w/ Claude 2026</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Major announcements: Claude Code rate limits doubling, <span class=\"highlight\">17x YoY API volume increase</span>, Claude Managed Agents, Claude Desktop app, customer stories from Shopify and Mercado Libre.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"date-badge\">2026-05-06</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"topics\">\n                            <span class=\"tag\">anthropic</span>\n                            <span class=\"tag\">claude-code</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"insight-type opinion\">OPINION</div>\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/May/6/vibe-coding-agentic-engineering/\" target=\"_blank\">Vibe coding and agentic engineering</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            Simon Willison explores convergence of \"vibe coding\" (iterative experimentation) and \"agentic engineering\" (systematic AI-driven development) raising questions about future of software development.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"date-badge\">2026-05-06</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"topics\">\n                            <span class=\"tag\">vibe-coding</span>\n                            <span class=\"tag\">philosophy</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"item\">\n                        <div class=\"insight-type technical\">TECHNICAL</div>\n                        <div class=\"item-title\">\n                            <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/May/6/redis-arrays/\" target=\"_blank\">Redis Arrays: New Data Type</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-description\">\n                            antirez proposed adding new \"array\" data type to Redis with 21 new commands including ARGREP for server-side grep using TRE regex library.\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                            <span class=\"date-badge\">2026-05-06</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"topics\">\n                            <span class=\"tag\">redis</span>\n                            <span class=\"tag\">databases</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n        </main>\n    </div>\n\n    <footer class=\"footer\">\n        <p>\n            Generated by <a href=\"#\">Agent Code Daily</a> • Powered by <a href=\"https://claude.com/claude-code\">Claude Agent SDK</a><br>\n            <a href=\"#top\">Back to top</a> • <a href=\"https://github.com/agentdaily/agentdaily\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub</a> • <span>Generated: 2026-05-13</span>\n        </p>\n    </footer>\n</body>\n</html>",
